Spec: SDK-only secure stream application

Purpose:
  Serve and consume authenticated application traffic through a separately launched trusted Agent.

Owns:
  ./SecureApp.csproj
  ./Program.cs

References:
  /windows/LinkGate.Client/BusinessConnections.sdd

Must:
  Depend only on the public SDK and framework libraries; carry no Broker, SQLite or device keys.
  Pin the explicitly supplied Agent executable digest and hold its process identity for all control/data attachments.
  Preserve HTTPS and WebSocket authority, application bearer authentication and certificate validation.
  Persist application operation IDs and never automatically repeat failed or ambiguous business opens.
